* Tube Channel power supply: centre-tapped transformer secondary, rectifiers, voltage multipliers,
* regulators and the tube plate supply. Sources and regulators are driven from code.
.model D1N4004 D(IS=76.9p RS=42m N=1.45 BV=400 IBV=5u)
.model DZ47 D(IS=1n RS=15 N=1.5 BV=47 IBV=1m)

LS1 nS1 P7 2m
LS2 nS2 P5 2m

* +/-25 V raw: full-wave centre-tap rectifier
D30 P7 P25 D1N4004
D32 P5 P25 D1N4004
C27 P7 P5 0.1u
C78 P25 0 1000u
D27 N25 P7 D1N4004
D28 N25 P5 D1N4004
C28 P7 P5 0.1u
C74 0 N25 1000u

* regulated +/-15 V (the regulators themselves are driven from code) with the heater bypass resistors
C69 P15 0 10u
R245 P25 P15 47
C70 0 N15 10u
R41 N15 N25 47
D26 N15 0 D1N4004

* +75 V doubler stacked on +25 V
C76 P7 nD33 100u
D33 P25 nD33 D1N4004
D29 nD33 P75 D1N4004
C77 P75 P25 100u

* +70 V and the +45 V series regulator
R181 P75 P70 150
C72 P70 0 100u
R173 P70 nZ1 4.99k
R176 nZ1 B20 4.99k
C75 nZ1 0 100u
D25 0 B20 DZ47
XQ20 P70 B20 P45 TIP112
C22 P45 0 100u

* +150 V: two more multiplier stages
C79 P7 nD34 100u
D34 P75 nD34 D1N4004
D31 nD34 P125 D1N4004
C201 P125 P75 100u
C200 P7 nD203 100u
D203 P125 nD203 D1N4004
D202 nD203 nP150 D1N4004
C202 nP150 0 100u
D201 nP150 nD200 D1N4004
D200 nD200 nR244 D1N4004
R244 nR244 P150 150
C203 P150 0 100u

* heaters (series 12.6 V heaters, about 150 mA)
R30 P15 nH1 27
RH1 nH1 0 84
RH3 0 nH3 84
R160 nH3 N15 27

* tube plate supply: HIGH = pass transistor from +150 V (saturated, modelled as 110 ohm), NORMAL = from +45 V
* through a diode. HV is set from code.
.param HV=1 BIG=1e9
D7 P150 nT1 D1N4004
D9 nT1 nT2 D1N4004
R50 nT2 TUBEP {if(HV>0,110,BIG)}
D10 P45 TUBEP D1N4004
C15 TUBEP 0 100u
